<title>USA: Bell Atlantic, NYNEX name group CEO.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic, NYNEX name group CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Atlantic Corp and NYNEX Corp said Wednesday that Larry Babbio has been named president and chief executive of the network group of the soon-to-be-merged companies.</p>
<p>He succeeds Dick Jalkut, who announced his retirement earlier this week.</p>
<p>Babbio also has been named chairman of the global wireless group of the new Bell Atlantic.</p>
<p>The merger of the two companies is expected to be completed by the end of March.</p>
</text>
